{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_03FE00","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"听说那里现在到处都是Chicolibrí。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":44,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"所谓Chicolibrí，就是绑走Chico的那种<R=机器,MACHINE>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=机器,MACHINE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":67,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"我们这么叫它，是因为这个名字有“Colibrí的<R=孩子,CHICO>”的意思。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=孩子,CHICO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"任务期间看来没法补充弹药。注意别浪费子弹。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"不过，那里有美国雇佣兵设置的机枪座。好好利用它们。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""}]}